#                               displaces nor lifts it)
#
# Forward-composition surfaces (named, not imported; land at Arc-2.3+):
#   @secrets                  — key-gated projection; discharges at
#                               @io boundary; per Alex 2026-07-14
#                               "@secrets prism ... project through
